cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use agent-plugins or its bench in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "agent-plugins: cognitive scaffolding for coding agents"
abstract: >-
  Eight self-monitoring plugins for coding agents (Claude Code, Codex, Cursor
  and Agent Plugins hosts). Each is a skill plus, where the host allows it,
  hooks that put a concrete fact in front of the agent at the moment it matters
  and ask for the decision in a fixed block with an honest way out. The
  repository includes an isolated, audited outcome bench that measures whether
  the plugins change what the agent does.
